sode V: The Empire Strikes Back \n \u2022 Star Wars Episode VI: Return of the Jedi \n \u2022 Rogue One: A Star Wars Story\n \u2022 Star Wars Rebels\n \u2022 Masters of the Force\n \u2022 Classic Collectibles\n \n Exciting new features exclusive to this release: \n \u2022 The fully customizable FAN CAVE houses your \u201cvirtual\u201d pinball table and items you earn. \n \u2022 TOTAL IMMERSION MODE allows you to experience everything at table level. \n \u2022 360-DEGREE MINIGAMES surround you with iconic Star Wars set pieces. \n \n Other features from past Star Wars\u2122 Pinball releases return: \n \u2022 HAPTIC FEEDBACK for controllers so it feels like actual pinball\n \u2022 CAREER MODE for short, targeted gameplay sessions\n \u2022 FORCE POWERS to power up your play\n \u2022 A CANTINA JUKEBOX of John Williams music", "short_description": "Play the latest  tables for free! Han Solo and Droids are now available in the Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR library! Relive the adventures of Solo and Chewbacca and help R2 & C-3PO in their quest to save the galaxy. "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1195903447920137", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR", "keywords": ["star", "wars", "pinball", "simulation", "arcade"], "long_description": "\"\u00a1Por primera vez, Star Wars\u2122 Pinball en realidad virtual! Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR re\u00fane 8 MESAS INCRE\u00cdBLES:\n \u2022 The Mandalorian\n \u2022 Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope\n \u2022 Star Wars Episode V: The Empire Strikes Back\n \u2022 Star Wars Episode VI: Return of the Jedi\n \u2022 Rogue One: A Star Wars Story\n \u2022 Star Wars Rebels\n \u2022 Masters of the Force\n \u2022 Classic Collectibles\n\n Nuevas y emocionantes caracter\u00edsticas exclusivas de este lanzamiento:\n \u2022 La CUEVA DEL FAN personalizable alberga tu mesa de pinball \"virtual\" y los objetos que consigas.\n \u2022 El MODO DE INMERSI\u00d3N TOTAL te permite experimentarlo todo al nivel de la mesa.\n \u2022 Los MINIJUEGOS DE 360 GRADOS te rodean con escenas emblem\u00e1ticas de Star Wars.\n\n Regresan otras caracter\u00edsticas de lanzamientos anteriores de Star Wars\u2122 Pinball\n \u2022 RESPUESTA H\u00c1PTICA para los mandos, para que parezca pinball de verdad.\n \u2022 MODO CARRERA para partidas cortas y enfocadas.\n \u2022 PODERES DE LA FUERZA para potenciar tu juego.\n \u2022 Una GRAMOLA DE LA CANTINA con m\u00fasica de John Williams", "short_description": "\u00a1Juega a las \u00faltimas mesas gratis! \u00a1Han Solo y Droids est\u00e1n ahora disponibles en la colecci\u00f3n de Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR! Revive las aventuras de Solo y Chewbacca y ayuda a R2 y C-3PO en su misi\u00f3n para salvar la galaxia."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1129893334236580", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR", "keywords": ["\ud540\ubcfc", "\uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158", "\uc544\ucf00\uc774\ub4dc", "\uc2a4\ud0c0", "\uc6cc\uc988"], "long_description": "\uc0ac\uc0c1 \ucc98\uc74c\uc73c\ub85c Star Wars\u2122 \ud540\ubcfc \uac8c\uc784\uc744 \uac00\uc0c1 \ud604\uc2e4\uc5d0\uc11c \uc990\uae38 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! <Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR>\uc5d0\uc11c \ub9cc\ub098\ubcf4\uc2e4 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \ud765\ubbf8\uc9c4\uc9c4\ud55c 8\uac1c\uc758 \ud14c\uc774\ube14\uc744 \uc18c\uac1c\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n \u2022 The Mandalorian \n \u2022 A New Hope \n \u2022 The Empire Strikes Back \n \u2022 Return of the Jedi \n \u2022 Rogue One\n \u2022 Star Wars\u2122 Rebels\n \u2022 Masters of the Force\n \u2022 Classic Collectibles\n \n \ucd9c\uc2dc\uc640 \ud568\uaed8 \uc81c\uacf5\ub418\ub294 \ud2b9\ubcc4 \ud55c\uc815 \ucee8\ud150\uce20:\n \u2022 \ud32c \uc18c\uad74\uc5d0\uc11c \u201c\uac00\uc0c1\u201d \ud540\ubcfc \ud14c\uc774\ube14\uc744 \uc990\uae30\uace0, \ud68d\ub4dd\ud55c \uc544\uc774\ud15c\ub4e4\uc744 \ud655\uc778\ud558\uba70 \uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\ub9cc\uc758 \ub3c5\ud2b9\ud55c \uacf5\uac04\uc73c\ub85c \uafb8\uba70\ubcf4\uc138\uc694.\n \u2022 \uc644\uc804 \ubab0\uc785 \ubaa8\ub4dc\ub97c \ud1b5\ud574 \ud540\ubcfc \ud14c\uc774\ube14 \uc704\uc5d0\uc11c \ubc8c\uc5b4\uc9c0\ub294 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc77c\ub4e4\uc744 \uc0dd\uc0dd\ud558\uac8c \uacbd\ud5d8\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n \u2022 360\ub3c4 \ubbf8\ub2c8 \uac8c\uc784\uc744 \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ud558\uba70 \ubaa8\ub450\uc5d0\uac8c \uc0ac\ub791\ubc1b\ub294 Star Wars\u2122\uc758 \ubc30\uacbd \uc74c\uc545\uc744 \uc990\uae30\uc138\uc694.\n\n \uc9c0\ub09c Star Wars\u2122 Pinball \uac8c\uc784\ub4e4\uc5d0\uc11c\ub3c4 \uc120\ubcf4\uc600\ub358 \uac8c\uc784 \ubaa8\ub4dc \ubc0f \uae30\ub2a5:\n \u2022 \ud585\ud2f1 \ud53c\ub4dc\ubc31\uc774 \uc801\uc6a9\ub41c \ucee8\ud2b8\ub864\ub7ec\ub85c \uc2e4\uc81c \ud540\ubcfc\uc744 \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ud558\ub294 \ub4ef\ud55c \uc0dd\uc0dd\ud568\n \u2022 \uc9e7\uace0 \uac04\ub2e8\ud55c \ubaa9\ud45c\ub97c \ud074\ub9ac\uc5b4\ud558\uba70 \uc9c4\ud589\ud574 \ub098\uac00\ub294 \ucee4\ub9ac\uc5b4 \ubaa8\ub4dc\n \u2022 \ub354\uc6b1 \ud30c\uc6cc \uc5c5\ub41c \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ub97c \uc81c\uacf5\ud558\ub294 \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \uc885\ub958\uc758 \ud3ec\uc2a4 \ud30c\uc6cc\n \u2022 John Williams\uc758 \uc74c\uc545\uc774 \ub4e4\uc5b4 \uc788\ub294 \uce78\ud2f0\ub098 \uc8fc\ud06c\ubc15\uc2a4", "short_description": "\ud765\ubbf8\uc9c4\uc9c4\ud55c \ud540\ubcfc \uac8c\uc784\uc744 \uc120\ubcf4\uc774\ub294 <Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR>\uc774 \uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\uc744 \uae30\ub2e4\ub9bd\ub2c8\ub2e4! Star Wars\u2122 \ud504\ub79c\ucc28\uc774\uc988\uc758 \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \uc791\ud488\ub4e4\uc744 \uae30\ubc18\uc73c\ub85c \ud55c 8\uac1c\uc758 \ud540\ubcfc \ud14c\uc774\ube14\uc744 \uc18c\uac1c\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n \u2022 The Mandalorian\n \u2022 A New Hope \n \u2022 The Empire Strikes Back \n \u2022 Return of the Jedi \n \u2022 Rogue One \n \u2022 Star Wars Rebels \n \u2022 Masters of the Force \n \u2022 Classic Collectibles \n \n\uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\ub9cc\uc758 \ud32c \uc18c\uad74\uc744 \uafb8\uba70 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1014174855959074", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR", "keywords": ["star", "wars", "pinball", "simulation", "arcade"], "long_description": "Per la prima volta Star Wars\u2122 Pinball \u00e8 disponibile in realt\u00e0 virtuale! Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR raccoglie 8 FAVOLOSI TAVOLI:\n \u2022 The Mandalorian\n \u2022 Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope \n \u2022 Star Wars Episode V: The Empire Strikes Back \n \u2022 Star Wars Episode VI: Return of the Jedi \n \u2022 Rogue One: A Star Wars Story\n \u2022 Star Wars Rebels\n \u2022 Masters of the Force\n \u2022 Classic Collectibles\n \n Nuove funzionalit\u00e0 esclusive di questa edizione: \n \u2022 La GROTTA DEI FAN personalizzabile, che include il tuo tavolo \"virtuale\" e gli oggetti che ottieni. \n \u2022 La MODALIT\u00c0 IMMERSIONE TOTALE, per vivere l'esperienza al livello del tavolo. \n \u2022 MINIGIOCHI A 360 GRADI con scene iconiche di Star Wars.\n \n Tornano inoltre altre funzionalit\u00e0 delle precedenti edizioni di Star Wars\u2122 Pinball:\n \u2022 FEEDBACK APTICO per i controller: per un realismo flipperistico ineguagliabile\n \u2022 MODALIT\u00c0 CARRIERA per sessioni di gioco brevi e mirate\n \u2022 POTERI DELLA FORZA per potenziare i tuoi tiri\n \u2022 JUKEBOX DELLA CANTINA con musiche di John Williams", "short_description": "Gioca gratuitamente ai tavoli pi\u00f9 recenti! Han Solo e Droids sono ora disponibili nella collezione Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR! Rivivi le avventure di Han Solo e Chewbecca e aiuta R2 e C-3PO nella loro missione per salvare la galassia. "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "331730048947905", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR", "keywords": ["star", "wars", "pinball", "arcade", "simulation"], "long_description": "Zum ersten Mal umgibt uns Star Wars\u2122 Pinball in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t! Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR bietet 8 FANTASTISCHE TISCHE:\n \u2022 The Mandalorian \n \u2022 Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope \n \u2022 Star Wars Episode V: The Empire Strikes Back \n \u2022 Star Wars Episode VI: Return of the Jedi \n \u2022 Rogue One: A Star Wars Story\n \u2022 Star Wars Rebels\n \u2022 Masters of the Force\n \u2022 Classic Collectibles\n \n Aufregende neue Funktionen exklusiv f\u00fcr diese Version: \n \u2022 Die komplett anpassbare FAN-H\u00d6HLE beherbergt deinen \u201evirtuellen\u201c Flippertisch und die Gegenst\u00e4nde, die du erh\u00e4ltst\n \u2022 Im TOTALES-EINTAUCHEN-MODUS erlebst du alles auf Tischniveau\n \u2022 360-GRAD-MINISPIELE umgeben dich mit kultigen Dingen aus den Kulissen von Star Wars.\n \n Funktionen aus fr\u00fcheren Star Wars\u2122 Pinball-Spielen kehren zur\u00fcck: \n \u2022 HAPTISCHES FEEDBACK f\u00fcr Controller f\u00fcr das echte Flipper-Gef\u00fchl\n \u2022 KARRIEREMODUS f\u00fcr kurze, gezielte Spielsitzungen\n \u2022 KR\u00c4FTE DER MACHT, um dein Spiel zu st\u00e4rken\n \u2022 Eine CANTINA JUKEBOX mit Musik von John Williams", "short_description": "Spiele die neuesten Tische kostenlos! Han Solo und Droids sind jetzt in der Star Wars\u2122 Pinball VR-Bibliothek verf\u00fcgbar! Erlebe die Abenteuer von Solo und Chewbacca und hilf R2 und C-3PO bei ihrer Aufgabe, die Galaxie zu retten."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://zenstudios.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://zenstudios.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "Zen Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://starwarspinball.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT